      "created_at": "2014-08-12T21:16:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the fast response. The rulebook recommends skirmishes first. I got everything open and somewhat sorted. I know its going to take a playthrough or two to get a good feel for things. Looks awesome. Lots of stuff included. Plan on playing it with my group tomorrow.</p><p>The scenarioes look awesome as well. I like the comics that set them up and segue to the next part. Top notch. Glad I ks'd it.</p>",
