      "created_at": "2014-08-12T21:20:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the rulebook is a little schizo about skirmishes, isn't it?&nbsp; The \"Introduction\" section on page 1 recommends you start with the rules in the rulebook before trying out scenarios, but then it talks about skirmishes in the \"Advanced Rules\" section on page 11.&nbsp; Skirmishes are simultaneously the basic way new players should play and the advanced way experts should play, somehow. :)</p>",
