      "name": "kitmehsu",
      "username": "kitmehsu",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/{size}/1901_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-13T14:21:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Has anyone given thought to 2v2v2 or 3v3v3 skirmishes, with treats scoring a point for every incap they cause instead of tracking your own incaps? &nbsp;Was wondering as otherwise it's really har to run something with 3 players.&nbsp;</p>",
