    {
      "id": 113978,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-13T14:48:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Used to run 3 player battles and they were crazy fun. &nbsp;We went by incaps eliminations style, with limited respawns, when you ran out of respawns your characters leave play when incapped.</p><p>It was fun because alliances changed constantly, and more than once a betrayal occurred.</p><p>It was fun.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I like doing tag-team skirmishes, when your character is incapped they leave play and when they would stand up a new hero enters the field from a designated area. &nbsp;You can rotate 3 heroes or draft a big team and work through the roster, but it works well, because you get incapped you lose that hero and have to re-enter the battle.</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:45:44.973Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
