      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Used to run 3 player battles and they were crazy fun. &nbsp;We went by incaps eliminations style, with limited respawns, when you ran out of respawns your characters leave play when incapped.</p><p>It was fun because alliances changed constantly, and more than once a betrayal occurred.</p><p>It was fun.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I like doing tag-team skirmishes, when your character is incapped they leave play and when they would stand up a new hero enters the field from a designated area. &nbsp;You can rotate 3 heroes or draft a big team and work through the roster, but it works well, because you get incapped you lose that hero and have to re-enter the battle.</p>",
